        <name>Pioneer XDJ-AERO</name>
        <author>openDJ</author>
        <description>openDJ mapping for the XDJ-AERO all-in-one in PC control (MIDI) mode: two decks, the mixer, an effect unit on each deck and Sound Color FX knobs. Beta: written from the XDJ-AERO's MIDI messages as rekordbox maps them, not yet tried on the hardware.</description>
        <manual>pioneer_xdj_aero</manual>
    </info>
